'''Hover barges'''<ref name="Art-JFO">''[[The Art of Star Wars Jedi: Fallen Order]]''</ref> were [[repulsorlift]] vehicles designed for transportation. They were used by the [[Scrapper Guild]] on [[Bracca]], where they were used to [[transport]] workers to their job sites and scavenged [[Starship|ship]] components, as well as dump trash directly into the [[Ibdis Maw]].<ref name="JFO">''[[Star Wars Jedi: Fallen Order]]''</ref>

